      <title>Small Business Agenda Survey Closes this Friday</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">45116855</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/2b06db7</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" style="background-color: #000000; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#000000">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2017/11/1650665/govdelivery-development_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Department of Development" width="600" height="225">
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td id="main-date" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Date" class="thin" style="background-color: #eeeeee; padding: 15px;" bgcolor="#eeeeee">
<h1 style="line-height: 110%; font-weight: normal; color: #000000; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; margin: 0;">Small Business Agenda <br><strong>Impact Measurement Survey</strong>
</h1>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Dear Business Advocate:</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">This is a final reminder that the City of Columbus is conducting an important survey of the small business ecosystem.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Simply click on this address to go directly to the survey: <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942628/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-ESO?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942628/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-ESO</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">In addition, <strong>we would greatly appreciate if you could forward a separate, small business survey to business owners in your distribution lists</strong> if you have not yet done so. To facilitate this, we are attaching an email template that you may use when communicating to business owners with this request.</p>
<div>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><strong> </strong></p>
</div>
<hr>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><strong><em><br>Small Business Owner Template</em></strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Dear Columbus Business Owner:</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">I write to you with an ask to support the Columbus Small Business Ecosystem. As you may know, the mission of the City of Columbus Small Business Agenda is to cultivate an inclusive, dynamic, and continuously improving small business ecosystem that enables all entrepreneurs to enjoy equitable opportunity for success that contributes to local economic development outcomes. To that end, the City has developed a survey targeting small businesses to inform the progress towards that mission.</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Survey Link: <a href="https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942991/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-SMB?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942991/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-SMB</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">The time to completion is estimated to be 10 minutes. We appreciate your dedication to completing the full survey; your input is invaluable in shaping the future for small businesses in Columbus. Business owners that complete this survey will be entered into a raffle to win a $50 gift card. For questions regarding the survey, please contact Celeste LaCour-Belyn at <a href="mailto:CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov</a>. </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;" align="start">Thank you for both your time and thoughtfulness on this survey, and we look forward to your involvement in this work.<br><br></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Sincerely,</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Henry A. Golatt Program Development Coordinator</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/development/economic-development/Small-Business/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Office of Small Business and Entrepreneur Development</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em> </em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"><em>“Together, Let’s Make Positive Impacts”</em></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">City of Columbus</p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Department of Development</p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;" align="start">Economic Development Division<br><br><br></p>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">

</td>
</tr>

