<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">I write to you with an ask to support the Columbus Small Business Ecosystem. As you may know, the mission of the City of Columbus Small Business Agenda is to cultivate an inclusive, dynamic, and continuously improving small business ecosystem that enables all entrepreneurs to enjoy equitable opportunity for success that contributes to local economic development outcomes. To that end, the City has developed a survey targeting entrepreneur service organizations (ESOs) to inform the progress towards that mission.</p>
