<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">Survey Link: <a href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?c=-w6k6JNa8GMRbEaiNwI08C5s5vDvjuBeGIGXIuELksM&d=DwMFaQ&e=&m=6cZS4KGG8gvZL-PpiwoRkjBSZ3OBDdzB4fmKi8iAe94&r=KjSL4M2WX5nAsSpYNr9nLHlgirAbRYVrBzITRHdyJXg&s=Idqt0DlomFgiE8WhqqLM_NJTznFhaL184X51q-gMN-g&u=https-3A__survey.alchemer.com_s3_5942991_Columbus-2DSmall-2DBusiness-2DAgenda-2DImpact-2DMeasurement-2DSMB-3Futm-5Fmedium-3Demail-26utm-5Fsource-3Dgovdelivery&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">https://survey.alchemer.com/s3/5942991/Columbus-Small-Business-Agenda-Impact-Measurement-SMB</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;"> </p>
<p style="line-height: 110%; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0;">The time to completion is estimated to be 20 minutes. We appreciate your dedication to completing the full survey; your input is invaluable in shaping the future for small businesses in Columbus. Business owners that complete this survey will be entered into a raffle to win a $50 gift card. For questions regarding the survey, please contact Celeste LaCour-Belyn at <a href="mailto:CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov" style="color: #00966a; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CCLaCour-Belyn@columbus.gov</a>. </p>
